<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Comstock Resources started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Comstock Resources started.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABN AMRO Chicago Corp said Monday it initiated coverage of Comstock Resources Inc with a hold rating.</p>
<p>The firm said its current valuation of Comstock shares is $9.57. It said the hold rating would be upgraded if the shares decline 10 to 12 percent or if a large, accretive acquisition is announced.</p>
<p>&quot;While we believe that over the long term the company will continue to achieve attractive growth rates and deliver increased shareholder value, our preference is to establish positions at a discount to our valuation,&quot; Chicago Corp said in a report.</p>
<p>Comstock shares were up 1/8 at 10.</p>
<p>Comstock is an independent oil and gas company which acquires, develops and exploits oil- and gas-producing properties.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
